comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-01T09:24:18.862Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live GH-1364 search across all statuses returned zero; pm-szn67i is closed for earlier strict-close/global scope corrections. Reuse recovery-closure lineage pm-f05lsg. GitHub issue remains the external owner; local implementation only."
  "2026-10-01T09:44:09.288Z","harness:codex","Current-main negative control: exact retry from two colliding trackers reads the default tracker and drops JSON and valid close_reason. New executable retry regression fails on untouched 89b4aa8bb; fixed branch passes with selected tracker, JSON, valid selectors, aliases, attached values and spaces. Expanded focused suite passed 58/58. Full coverage/static/package checks remain underway; no publishing authorized."
  "2026-10-01T15:01:58.882Z","harness:codex","Final packed CLI exact recovery replay passed selected colliding tracker, JSON and retained valid fields. Final source coverage runner exited 0: 9467 passed, two Windows-only skips, zero uncovered counts in all four dimensions. Generated changelog consistency and post-close graph/history/tracker assurance pass; hosted checks and PR review remain pending."
  "2026-10-01T15:32:45.273Z","harness:codex",Hosted Windows regression exposed a POSIX path literal in the new refusal fixture. Expected scope now uses platform path.join; exact argv and unsafe-scope negative control are unchanged. Added structured gate evidence required by the post-close defect gate. Prior static success preceded closure and did not validate this terminal-only requirement; final checks are rerunning.
  "2026-10-01T17:59:46.045Z","harness:codex","Recovery review corrections pass focused CLI/SDK replay tests, lint and all four type checks: legacy/canonical tracker flags consume flag-looking values including literal --, selected full/brief/compact survives generic suggestions, and supported root --explain remains intact before/after the command. Actual CLI already normalizes both token_budget forms before recovery; scanner now also canonicalizes declared aliases defensively. No merge or live telemetry transmission performed."
  "2026-10-01T18:31:00.168Z","harness:codex","Full-source linked run on dd42b1f3c recorded a failed receipt: 9472 passed, 12 failed, two skipped. One failure was the introduced 121-file SDK test directory; eleven were fixture behavior changed by inherited global telemetry opt-outs. No live telemetry was sent. Corrected directory grouping plus a process-only network namespace (loopback available, no external route; original host settings and queues untouched) now pass all 138 affected tests without weakening assertions. Full coverage will rerun under this containment; previous failed metrics are not passing evidence."
  "2026-10-01T18:55:48.713Z","harness:codex","Review correction: failed run test-local-mupv1k68-926ate now carries no measurements. Its four provisional 100-percent values were invalid because the coverage gate failed; the original failed receipt and immutable history remain intact. The CLI exposes no prior-receipt measurement edit, so this exact-row correction used the checked-out PM mutateItem test_run_track operation with automatic author, item locking, no force, and immutable history. Future measurements will be recorded only from an actually passing producing gate."
  "2026-10-01T18:57:02.287Z","harness:codex","Current post-reopen recovery receipt test-local-mupwadit-o8by2n passed the existing canonical focused command (CLI selected-tracker replay, projection-retry unit cases, closed-domain discovery). This reruns the corrected source without duplicating its linked test. It covers tracker-path aliases and flag-looking values, single full/brief/compact selection, root explain and both token_budget spellings. The failed aggregate run remains failed with no measurements; full-source verification is pending."
  "2026-10-01T19:40:37.587Z","harness:codex","Hosted static import-boundary failure corrected by removing a private bootstrap-scanner import: canonical pm-path arity and declared alias metadata now cover legacy paths, while every other option retains contract-driven arity. Current focused suite passes 77 tests, lint, all four type configurations, and the exact SDK import-boundary check has zero violations. The contained full-source attempt stopped without a final exit report or receipt and is uncompleted, not passing evidence; a supervised retry will use final source with no provisional measurements."
  "2026-10-01T20:04:32.788Z","harness:codex","Current verification receipts: test-local-mupyio63-jdx8vs passes the exact latest four-file focused command (77 tests); test-local-mupymsom-icnh18 passes focused ESLint, all four type configurations and the exact SDK import-boundary check. Full-source producing receipt test-local-mupyg89a-2vgwyc is failed (9484 test cases passed, ten failed, two platform skips) and carries no measurements. Two failures came from read-only home npm cache writes; the same two cases now pass with an isolated writable temporary npm cache. Eight failures were timeout or load-related. All hosted checks passed on source 7bdd9a05a. Active terminal fields and unsupported exact coverage claims remain cleared; another full attempt will retain the entire corpus and every existing assertion, timeout and coverage threshold while limiting workers."
  "2026-10-01T20:35:25.475Z","harness:codex","Final-source full coverage producing receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e (pm-gh1364) passed on 09ba3c30ec10e637f111b477a46e252b4558d241: 9494 test cases passed, zero failed, two Windows-only skips; exact integer gate passed for lines 63200/63200, statements 66237/66237, functions 13710/13710 and branches 50719/50719. Its canonical passing test_runs row now carries four observed percent gates plus all covered/total dimensions and test-case counts; linked-command passed=1 remains the runner's command count. coverage-summary SHA256=40c980160ae95b9591e5cbb4ac483ee7ca5d42ee7140beb205e2c1e9f38650c6. Measurements were attached only after the actual gate passed using PM's locked test_run_track operation, automatic author and immutable history. Earlier failed receipts remain failed without measurements. This is one shared full-corpus producing receipt, referenced through real related edges by pm-gh1370 and pm-gh1371, not three separate executions. Local static/context/package aggregates and final exact-head hosted/reviewer checks remain pending. No live telemetry delivery or merge performed."
  "2026-10-01T20:47:24.816Z","harness:codex","Final canonical full static receipt test-local-muq07idm-3sj1wf failed at SDK entrypoint import-time budgets: five medians exceeded their unchanged ceilings. Earlier static stages passed, but stages after this failure did not run and this receipt is not aggregate passing evidence. Exact import-time gate is being rerun alone before deciding whether a code regression or environmental variability is responsible. Full-source coverage receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e remains passed with verified measurements; closure and merge remain held."
  "2026-10-01T20:51:53.327Z","harness:codex","Import-time follow-up: direct default-five-sample recheck failed only graph (195 ms median versus 172 ms permitted). Canonical larger-sample receipt test-local-muq0cjcq-i81qdu failed only merge (237 ms median of 15 versus 226 ms permitted); graph cleared its unchanged ceiling. These are failed gates, not passing aggregate evidence. No budgets were changed. Remaining static stages are running separately, and a same-checkout PR-base comparison will distinguish patch-specific cost from timing variability before final closure."
